Package: vibecodedemulator
Version: 0.4.4
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libsdl2-2.0-0, libvulkan1, libgl1, libgtk-3-0, libstdc++6, libgcc-s1
Maintainer: VibeCodedEmulator staging
Description: Native local-ROM GBA and NDS player with graphical controls
 VibeCodedEmulator packages the portable libretro host, native Vulkan
 presentation with a desktop OpenGL fallback, native Linux audio, graphical
 controls, and local save storage. It does not use a browser renderer for gameplay.
